<title>RUSSIA: Oil spill at Russian Novorossiisk, but port open.</title>
<headline>Oil spill at Russian Novorossiisk, but port open.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nearly 400 tonnes of oil spilled at a terminal in Russia's Black Sea port of Novorossiisk when a pipeline burst open on Tuesday night, the Emergencies Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said that about 13 tonnes had spilled into the sea that the port was operating.</p>
</text>
